         <description>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List 0.47.2 opens large Stellarium collections faster, including when restoring the last collection at startup. Observing night shows matching targets in rank order as they are calculated and keeps Stop responsive. Changing the ranking or usable-time filter updates the table in small batches, reusing the calculated observing windows and preserving the selection of targets that remain visible.
            </p>
